Bring results into memory


compute() will bring the results of the Arrow query into memory as an Arrow Table.


nyc_taxi |&gt;                                                        
  group_by(year) |&gt; 
  summarize(total_rides = n()) |&gt; 
  arrange(desc(year)) |&gt; 
  compute()

